  "question": {
    "text": "A solid spherical ball of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>&nbsp;is connected to a point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> on the wall with the help of a string which makes an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo></math>&nbsp;with the vertical. The sphere&nbsp;can rotate freely about its central axis and it is set into rotational motion against the vertical face of the wall with an angular velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>rad</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. In how much time (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>) will it come to rest? [<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></math>]<br />\r<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/cd9b5746-cbb4-4d44-b94e-c7344643f06e-image11.jpeg\" style=\"height: 118px; width: 220px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "20",
  "solution": {
    "text": "FBD of the spherical ball<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/08168956-1d70-42a0-97b0-8bba646da59e-image12.jpeg\" style=\"height: 157px; width: 220px;\" /><br /><br />For translational equilibrium<br /><math><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math><br />T sin15° = N<br />Also <math><mi>τ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>L</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>M</mi><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Solving we get t = 20 s",
